{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and actuation interface, separating sensing (obstacle events) and motion commands. The specification enforces safe, conservative obstacle avoidance and steady exploration, prioritizing random_walk in clear states, short forward moves, and minimal recovery turns. Full rotation is reserved for deadlock recovery only.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for sensing and motion to reflect physical modularity.",
    "Specification automaton encodes safe, progress-oriented exploration: random_walk in clear, move_forward for short progress, rotate to recover from obstacles, and full_rotate only after repeated blockages."
